module

public import WeilConjectures.SixFunctors.ProEtale.FiniteCoefficient.Derived.CompletedExchange

/-!
# The completed extension-by-zero comparison

For a cartesian square `g' ≫ j = j' ≫ g''` of schemes with `j`, `j'` open immersions and
`I = (ϖ)` generated by a nonzerodivisor, the completed pullback of an extension by zero is the
completed extension by zero of the completed pullback:

`Lg''^*_comp (j_! K) ≅ (j'_! (Lg'^*_comp K))^`

naturally in `K ∈ D(U_proét, R)` (blueprint `lem-cbc-completed-extension-zero-comparison`, in
its corrected form). The blueprint states the uncompleted target `j'_! Lg'^*_comp K`; that form
is false on pro-étale sites, since `j'_!` does not preserve derived completeness (see the
docstring of
`AlgebraicGeometry.ProEtale.completedRightDerivedLowerShriekOfCompactificationBaseChangeMap`).
-/

@[expose] public section

universe u

open CategoryTheory

open scoped CategoryTheory.Functor

namespace AlgebraicGeometry.ProEtale

open Scheme

variable {R : Type (u + 1)} [CommRing R] (I : Ideal R)
  (hI : ∃ ϖ ∈ nonZeroDivisors R, I = Ideal.span {ϖ})
  {U' U Z' Z : Scheme.{u}} {g' : U' ⟶ U} {j' : U' ⟶ Z'} {j : U ⟶ Z} {g'' : Z' ⟶ Z}
  [IsOpenImmersion j] [IsOpenImmersion j']

/-- Blueprint `lem-cbc-completed-extension-zero-comparison` (corrected): Completed
extension-by-zero base change.

For a cartesian square `g' ≫ j = j' ≫ g''` with `j`, `j'` open immersions, the completed
pullback of `j_! K` is the derived completion of `j'_!` of the completed pullback of `K`:
`Lg''^*_comp (j_! K) ≅ (j'_! (Lg'^*_comp K))^`, naturally in `K`. It is the completion of the
base change isomorphism `Lg'^* ⋙ j'_! ≅ j_! ⋙ Lg''^*`
(`AlgebraicGeometry.ProEtale.leftDerivedOpenImmersionLowerShriekBaseChangeIso`), followed by the
completion of `j'_!` of the completion map of `Lg'^* K`, an isomorphism after completion
(`AlgebraicGeometry.ProEtale.isIso_completionMapOpenImmersionLowerShriek`).

The blueprint's target `j'_! Lg'^*_comp K` is not completed; that form is false, `j'_!` not
preserving derived completeness on pro-étale sites. -/
noncomputable def completedUpperStarOpenImmersionLowerShriekIso (hsq : IsPullback g' j' j g'') :
    D((j)_!open[ModuleCat.{u + 1} R]) ⋙ completedUpperStar I hI g'' ⋙
        (_root_.DerivedCategory.derivedComplete (Scheme.ProEt.topology Z') I).ι ≅
      completedUpperStar I hI g' ⋙
        (_root_.DerivedCategory.derivedComplete (Scheme.ProEt.topology U') I).ι ⋙
        D((j')_!open[ModuleCat.{u + 1} R]) ⋙ completion I hI Z' :=
  Functor.isoWhiskerRight
      (leftDerivedOpenImmersionLowerShriekBaseChangeIso (ModuleCat.{u + 1} R) hsq).symm
      (completion I hI Z') ≪≫
    asIso (completionMapOpenImmersionLowerShriek I hI (g' := g') (j' := j'))

end AlgebraicGeometry.ProEtale
